# "steel gtr" (lead): plucks over the velocity range (soft = dark thump, hard = bright pick), a held note that
# rings on, and short notes muted by note-off.
tempo 110
steps 16
tail 1.5
track lead
preset 75 150 0 0 255 60 0 0 128 0 128 190 0 0 0 0 0 0
note 0 E3 4 127
note 1 B3 3 90
note 2 E4 2 60
note 3 Ab4 5 30
note 8 A3 1 127
note 9 Db4 1 100
note 10 E4 1 70
note 11 A4 1 40
note 12 E5 4 120
expect sound 0 16
expect idle 30
expect peak_below -6
